<title>GERMANY: Rheinhyp 9-mo oper profit up 17.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Rheinhyp 9-mo oper profit up 17.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Oper profit after provisions	    246.9  vs 209.7</p>
<p>    Risk provisions			     75.0   vs 82.5</p>
<p>    Net interest and commission income    420.5  vs 384.0</p>
<p>    Administration costs			99.3   vs 91.9</p>
<p>    Total new loan approvals		  10,075 vs 10,655</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German bank is mortgage bank is Rheinhyp Rheinische Hypothekenbank AG, a subsidiary of Commerzbank AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
